# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# The tolerance formula of cadkernel's brep::operation_tolerance (src/brep/
# bounds.rs at 953d546b68aef4b6692566a1a9b077fc5bd9fb4f), separated from its
# body traversal so that representations other than B-rep bodies apply the
# identical value. `extent` is the largest bounding-box side, at least 1;
# `coordinateScale` the largest absolute coordinate, at least 1.
import lib/std.dl

function the cad operation tolerance for extent {a 64 bit floating-point number:spanValue} and coordinate scale {a 64 bit floating-point number:scaleValue}:
    execute:
        return (spanValue * 1e-8) + ((2.220446049250313e-16 * scaleValue) * 64.0)
